      <token>_a5</token>
      <token>-a5</token>
    </tokens>
    <aliases>
      <alias>Innioasis A5</alias>
    </aliases>
    <notes>
      Flashed through the same MediaTek flow as the Y series (see the
      rom_a5.zip handling in src/catalog.py). Marketing has used both the
      Timmkoo and Innioasis names for this hardware, so both are accepted.
    </notes>
  </model>

